sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor HR as HR manager
    participant UI as React app
    participant API as API (Express)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Mail as Brevo

    Note over HR,Mail: Sign in
    HR->>UI: Enter email and password
    UI->>API: POST /api/auth/login
    API->>DB: Find active user by email
    API->>API: Verify Argon2id hash
    API-->>UI: 200 with Set-Cookie: JWT (httpOnly, Secure, SameSite=Lax, 8 hours)
    UI->>API: Later calls send the cookie automatically
    API->>API: Check signature, expiry and token version, then build the role and country scope

    Note over HR,Mail: Forgot password, or a new user invited by a global HR user
    HR->>UI: Ask for a reset link
    UI->>API: POST /api/auth/forgot-password
    API->>DB: If the user exists, store a hash of a random token (reset 30 minutes, invite 72 hours)
    API->>Mail: Send email with the link
    API-->>UI: 202, same response whether or not the email exists
    Mail-->>HR: Email with single-use link
    HR->>UI: Open link and choose a password
    UI->>API: POST /api/auth/set-password
    API->>DB: Check token, save new hash, mark token used, raise token version
    API-->>UI: 204, older sessions stop working
